							2134.269,
							200.528,
							9910.686
						],
						"pointId": 16490
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761920101,
					"content": "Looks like today's not our lucky day... We've been waiting so long and haven't even spotted a single ordinary Frostfin Whale...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920102,
					"content": "Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920103,
					"content": "Hmm... Maybe we should call it a day and head back. There'll be other chances.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920104,
					"content": "But... you're only back for a short while before you leave for other places again, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920105,
					"content": "Let's wait a bit longer, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920106,
					"content": "Wait... Helka, is that you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920107,
					"content": "Linnea! Yes, I'm back. But my archive isn't quite complete yet, so our showdown will have to wait.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920108,
					"content": "Oh? So the trip was fruitful, then. I haven't been idle either, and I added quite a bit to my own records.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920109,
					"content": "Did you come to see the Frostfin Whale too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920110,
					"content": "Yes. I heard it was only discovered recently. Considering its size, I suspect environmental changes caused the shift in its skin color.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920111,
					"content": "Like the concentration of kuuvahki in the area, for example...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920112,
					"content": "It's a shame, but we probably won't see it today. We've waited so long, and we've got nothing to show for it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920113,
					"content": "Linnea... back me up here! Let's just call it a day and head back, Maisie...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920114,
					"content": "I'm fine. I feel better than usual since I woke up this morning. Let's wait a little longer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920115,
					"content": "I heard that anyone who sees the Frostfin Whale can have their wish come true. So... it's supposed to bring good luck, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920116,
					"content": "I hope you can take the luck it brings with you on your next journey, Helka.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920117,
					"content": "But...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920118,
					"content": "Let's wait together, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920119,
					"content": "...Linnea!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920120,
					"content": "Don't worry. I have a feeling we're going to see that Frostfin Whale today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920121,
					"content": "You know how it is, Helka. My instincts are always right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920122,
					"content": "Alright... then we'll wait a little longer. But just a little, okay?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920123,
					"content": "A while later...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761920124,
					"content": "Look, look! Wow, it jumped so high!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920125,
					"content": "I wish I could swim that fast too... Swimming with them must be so much fun!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920126,
					"content": "Let's just jump in now—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920127,
					"content": "Hey! That's too dangerous! Geez, nothing's changed while I was away. You're still as reckless as ever...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Helka"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920128,
					"content": "W—What? Don't you want to play with them too? They're having so much fun!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920129,
					"content": "But if your clothes get wet, you might catch a cold. Why not stay on shore and use the Kamera to capture them having fun?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maisie"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920130,
					"content": "Hmm... makes sense. Then I'll borrow Helka's Kamera for a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				}
			]
		},
